#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:5 59cfdcb195744808a497abd1e7eaa857
msgid "Understanding SITL with RealFlight"
msgstr "了解 SITL (软件在环仿真) 与 RealFlight 的配合"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:7 1c7fa61a930141cbbf658e192d7ef566
msgid ""
"This document will explain how SITL communicates with RealFlight for "
"graphical simulations. In order to do any simulation you need several "
"elements:"
msgstr "本文档将介绍 SITL (软件在环仿真) 如何与 RealFlight 进行图形仿真通信。要进行任何仿真，您需要以下几个要素："

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:9 0740f11f947c4c4da6c5eb6819743265
msgid ""
"A model of the vehicle, including its physical characteristics and their "
"impacts on the physics model, control mechanisms, and a graphical data base "
"of its appearance."
msgstr "飞行器模型，包括其物理特性及对物理模型的影响、控制机制，以及外观图形数据库。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:11 67f6b4db32ce4c26ad65d4eb2709b016
msgid ""
"Physics models that will predict vehicle dynamics (attitude, velocity, "
"positions,etc.) based on control inputs into the vehicle model"
msgstr "根据飞行器模型的控制输入预测飞行器动力学（姿态、速度、位置等）的物理模型。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:13 eab1acca2f02459a968cc376880b37b3
msgid ""
"Graphics interpreter and display that takes the physics model's output and "
"produces the graphics display of vehicle movement"
msgstr "图形解释器和显示器，接收物理模型的输出并产生飞行器运动的图形显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:15 d5b906b49d5a4a84ba39e6f3a801a72a
msgid ""
"A controller mechanism to produce control inputs into the physics model to "
"command vehicle behavior"
msgstr "控制器机制，向物理模型产生控制输入以指挥飞行器行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:18 2a61b73637f84c38bbd026a38a6307cb
msgid ""
"In a normal RealFlight (RF) simulation, RF has built-in models, physics "
"modeling, and graphic interpreter/display. Control is input via a simulation"
" controller, such as the Interlink controller, joystick, or OpenTX "
"transmitter in joystick mode."
msgstr ""
"在正常的 RealFlight（RF）仿真中，RF 具有内置模型、物理建模以及图形解释器/显示器。控制通过仿真控制器输入，例如 Interlink "
"控制器、摇杆，或摇杆模式下的 OpenTX 发射机。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:20 ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:48
#: 6e8fbcfd776a48ed95e462d827c3b595 d4a8b271b57c4ac780e7e0d404582e55
msgid "This is illustrated below:"
msgstr "如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:26 9d817d4da7654d9682754f75cb0eb3e1
msgid ""
"The simulation controller outputs are mapped to \"TX channels\" by the RF "
"controller editor to produce mapped RC outputs. For the InterLink controller"
" these are fixed and read-only."
msgstr ""
"仿真控制器输出由 RF 控制器编辑器映射到「TX 通道」，以产生映射后的 RC 输出。对于 InterLink 控制器，这些映射是固定且只读的。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:28 e09e93bce3e8433ca575ea400447133a
msgid ""
"They are input into the RealFlight vehicle model which is described by its "
".RFX file(archive actually). Most models have a \"software radio\" which "
"take these \"TX channels\" and convert them into \"RX channels\", like a "
"receiver. This \"software radio\" can also create dual rates, adjust trim, "
"throw and reverses, etc. These received channels then drive motors, servos, "
"or flight controller/mixers setup in the model files which drive the "
"vehicle's actuators."
msgstr ""
"这些输出被输入到由 .RFX 文件（实际上是压缩包）描述的 RealFlight 飞行器模型中。大多数模型都有一个「软件无线电」，它接收这些「TX "
"通道」并将其转换为「RX "
"通道」，类似于接收机。该「软件无线电」还可以设置双比率、调整微调、舵量和舵反等。这些接收通道随后驱动模型文件中设置的电机、舵机或飞控/混控器，进而驱动飞行器的执行机构。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:30 b179fc4ef6fc43f28b81c47b413097e3
msgid ""
"The Physics models takes these inputs, including the vehicles described "
"physical characteristics from the model's files and predicts the vehicle's "
"motion which is then graphically displayed."
msgstr "物理模型接收这些输入，包括模型文件中描述的飞行器物理特性，并预测飞行器运动，然后以图形方式显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:32 ea24c9aefe3a4e4880de1966a68569d3
msgid ""
"The pilot provides the \"autopilot\" function of inputing stick/switch "
"control via the simulator controller to direct vehicle desired behavior."
msgstr "飞行员通过仿真控制器输入摇杆/开关控制，提供「自动驾驶」功能，以引导飞行器期望的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:34 12a0a9dd0cbe4069ad1c0be3096b5b30
msgid "An illustration of what constitutes a RealFlight model is show below:"
msgstr "RealFlight 模型构成的示意图如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:41 740e4a33dcc2445c93c3373f225817ab
msgid "SITL Using the FlightAxis Interface"
msgstr "使用 FlightAxis 接口的 SITL (软件在环仿真)"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:44 3b472bbc5e39444cb7680fa142f17128
msgid ""
"Using SITL to run the ArduPilot software basically is inserting an autopilot"
" between the simulation controller and the vehicle, just like in real "
"flight. This is done by tying a running SITL simulation  into RealFlight and"
" using its Physics models and Graphics for the simulation. The interface "
"between SITL and RealFlight is called FlightAxis."
msgstr ""
"使用 SITL (软件在环仿真) 运行 ArduPilot 软件，本质上是在仿真控制器和飞行器之间插入一个飞控，就像真实飞行一样。这通过将运行中的 "
"SITL 仿真接入 RealFlight 并使用其物理模型和图形进行仿真来实现。SITL 与 RealFlight 之间的接口称为 "
"FlightAxis。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:46 8ede8082b33d496189450475f17f526f
msgid ""
"When enabled in RealFlight, it exports the vehicle's predicted attitude, "
"velocities, position to SITL, as well as the outputs of the software radio "
"of the vehicle model its using. SITL uses these as RC and sensor inputs in "
"its sim and outputs servo functions  to RealFlight which it now interprets "
"as the RX channel radio outputs used by the model for its actuator inputs."
msgstr ""
"在 RealFlight 中启用后，它将飞行器的预测姿态、速度、位置以及所用飞行器模型软件无线电的输出导出到 SITL。SITL 将这些作为其仿真中的 "
"RC 和传感器输入，并向 RealFlight 输出舵机函数，RealFlight 现在将其解释为模型用于执行机构输入的 RX 通道无线电输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:53 62209a1d27ab4cc09bd7585ddec91118
msgid ""
"This basically inserts ArduPilot SITL simulation of the firmware between the"
" pilot and RealFlights inputs."
msgstr "这基本上是在飞行员和 RealFlight 输入之间插入了 ArduPilot 的 SITL 固件仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightaxis.rst:55 c10651f1fd0f4b4ea2e351bfac570dfb
msgid ""
"Presently, FlightAxis can transfer the first 12 RX channels from RealFlight "
"to SITL RC inputs, and the first 12 SERVO outputs from SITL to RealFlights "
"RX channel inputs."
msgstr ""
"目前，FlightAxis 可以将 RealFlight 的前 12 个 RX 通道传输到 SITL 的 RC 输入，并将 SITL 的前 12 "
"个舵机输出传输到 RealFlight 的 RX 通道输入。"
